  Introduction
  ============

    This contents of this archive will update a working installation of
    HydraBBS V1.04 to V1.05.

    This release contains two major bug fixes (if you had
    previously attempted to run HydraBBS, but it crashes, please
    download it again and try it now..)

    Also a few new features and updated docs.

